 the right condition to check at that point. Looking at the code flow, when the user swipes up to display history, the kiss bar should close first before showing the favorites, so checking `isViewingAllApps()` at that moment would correctly prevent the bar from staying hidden.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
{"type":"assistant","uuid":"ee5e7cdb-bef3-4a59-9ca8-374fa212c58e","session_id":"5c854a4c-6476-404e-a807-31d42da3b092","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"ee5e7cdb-bef3-4a59-9ca8-374fa212c58e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe fix is correctly applied. Let me provide a summary of the bug and the fix:\n\n## Bug Analysis\n\n**Root Cause:** In `ExperienceTweaks.updateSearchRecords()`, when the \"Hide favorites bar initially\" setting is enabled, the code unconditionally hides the favorites bar every time the search query is empty — including when the kiss bar is open.\n\n**The problematic flow:**\n1. User has \"Hide favorites bar initially\" + \"Minimalistic UI\" + \"Show favorites above search bar\" enabled\n2. Favorites bar starts hidden (correct)\n3. User opens the kiss bar → `searchEditText.setText(\"\")` triggers `updateSearchRecords(true, \"\")`\n4. `Favorites.updateSearchRecords(\"\")` correctly shows the favorites bar (query is empty)\n5. **Bug:** `ExperienceTweaks.updateSearchRecords(\"\")` then **immediately hides** the favorites bar because it doesn't check if the kiss bar is currently open\n6. Result: The favorites bar flickers or never appears\n\n**The Fix:** Added a condition `&& !mainActivity.isViewingAllApps()` to `ExperienceTweaks.updateSearchRecords()` so that when minimalistic mode is enabled for favorites, the favorites bar is only hidden when the user is NOT viewing the all-apps list (i.e., the kiss bar is closed).\n\n**Line 247 change:**\n```java\n// Before:\nif (isMinimalisticModeEnabledForFavorites()) {\n\n// After:\nif (isMinimalisticModeEnabledForFavorites() && !mainActivity.isViewingAllApps()) {\n```\n\n**Behavior after fix:**\n- **Kiss bar closed** (query empty): Favorites bar hidden (minimalistic mode respected) ✓\n- **Kiss bar open** (query empty): Favorites bar visible (user is browsing apps) ✓\n- **Kiss bar closed** (query non-empty): Favorites bar hidden (searching) ✓\n\n**Note:** The project's Gradle build depends on jcenter.bintray.com which is shut down, so the build cannot complete. However, the code change is syntactically correct (simple boolean AND condition addition) and follows the existing code style."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":58996,"output_tokens":925,"cache_read_input_tokens":56592,"total_tokens":59921}}}
