.com which is shut down, so the build cannot complete. However, the code change is syntactically correct (simple boolean AND condition addition) and follows the existing code style.","usage":{"input_tokens":1078234,"output_tokens":15516,"cache_read_input_tokens":1001888,"total_tokens":1093750},"permission_denials":[]}
